// Title: ESXi Network Configuration Discovery Via ESXCLI
// ID: 33e814e0-1f00-4e43-9c34-31fb7ae2b174
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Cedric Maurugeon
// Date: 2023-09-04
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.execution, attack.t1033, attack.t1007, attack.t1059.012
// Description: Detects execution of the "esxcli" command with the "network" flag in order to retrieve information about the network configuration.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

_sourceCategory=* | where (((CommandLine matches "* get*" or CommandLine matches "* list*")) and (Image matches "*/esxcli" and CommandLine matches "*network*"))
